                          huihui-ai's original work
                          (huihui-ai/Huihui-GLM-5.2-abliterated-GGUF).
- Weights served:         0xdfi/GLM-5.2-QuantTrio-Abliterated (HF, gated) — the
                          transplant of huihui-ai's abliteration into the
                          QuantTrio format. Refer to that repository for its
                          license, gate terms, and "as-is" disclaimers.
- Base checkpoint:        QuantTrio/GLM-5.2-Int4-Int8Mix.
- NVFP4 KV lineage:       danielwoz/vllm-dspark-nvfp4 (Apache-2.0) — the
                          nvfp4_ds_mla patch series our KV port adapts; Keys'
                          NVFP4 image lineage; b12x CuTe e2m1 helpers.
- sm_121 sparse-MLA:      CosmicRaisins/glm-5.2-gb10 (Apache-2.0), jasl/vllm.

The 4-node serving stack this builds on is documented in the companion
